  <Metadata>
    <Identity Language="en-US" Id="agile-analytics" Publisher="Baytek" Version="6.59.4"/>
    <DisplayName>Agile Analytics — Sprint Forecasting, Flow Metrics &amp; Dashboards for Azure DevOps</DisplayName>
    <Description xml:space="preserve">Azure DevOps extension: Monte Carlo forecasting, flow metrics, cycle time, aging WIP, DORA, sprint health and exec report. Four read-only scopes. 30-day free trial, no card.</Description>
    <GalleryFlags>Public</GalleryFlags>
    <Categories>Azure Boards,Azure Pipelines</Categories>
    <Tags>__DoNotDownload,agile,analytics,dashboard,insights,sprint,sprint planning,next sprint planning,velocity,cycle time,flow metrics,flow efficiency,service level expectations,monte carlo,wip,burndown,reporting,scrum,kanban,forecasting,team health,retrospective,dora,deployment frequency,lead time,change failure rate,investment allocation,executive report,sprint report,throughput,cumulative flow,capacity planning,engineering metrics,time to restore,predictability,sprint reporting,agile metrics,azure devops analytics,sprint analytics,team velocity,aging,work item age,aging wip,monte carlo forecasting,dora metrics,sprint health,aging work in progress,agile reporting,delivery forecasting,azure boards,scrum master,engineering manager</Tags>
